: justify;\">\n<span class=\"_4yxo\" style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: 600;\">-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<figure class=\"_2cuy _4nuy _2vxa _3tvj\" style=\"background-color: white; box-sizing: border-box; direction: ltr; margin: 0px auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; width: 700px;\"><div class=\"_h2x _4lh3\" style=\"clear: both; color: #1c1e21; float: left; font-family: inherit; line-height: 20px; margin: 0px 40px 40px 0px; text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"_h2z _297z _4lh5 img\" height=\"320\" id=\"u_97_3\" src=\"https://scontent.fkhh1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/93983249_2965793123513119_5208076230733070336_n.jpg?_nc_cat=111&amp;_nc_sid=32a93c&amp;_nc_ohc=HQLWkfKYhGkAX8CpgDv&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fkhh1-2.fna&amp;oh=55484ebc137c64869bf8a09414aceb85&amp;oe=5EC7931F\" style=\"border: 0px; max-height: 400px; max-width: 400px;\" width=\"228\" /></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #1c1e21; font-family: &quot;georgia&quot; , serif; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div>\n</figure><br />\n<div class=\"_2cuy _3dgx _2vxa\" style=\"background-color: white; box-sizing: border-box; color: #1c1e21; direction: ltr; font-family: georgia, serif; margin: 0px auto 28px; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; width: 700px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span class=\"_4yxo\" style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: 600;\">天涯‧人間‧晴美：黃晴美紀念文集</span> </div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n作者：黃文雄、鄭自才、黃晴美等 </div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n編者：廖宜恩、陳